sparkey (2.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build hash files faster: allocate the table with mmap and ask for huge
    pages, avoid 64-bit divisions, and prefetch hash table slots.
  * Look up keys faster: avoid 64-bit divisions, decompress snappy blocks
    only as far as a lookup reads, and reuse a zstd decompression context.
  * Iterate logs and hash files faster, and look up which puts are live in
    batches when iterating in hash order, for uncompressed logs too.
  * Write log entries that fit in the current buffer faster.
  * Hash keys faster by reading the tail of MurmurHash3 with word loads.
  * Reject hash files with a capacity of 0 as corrupt.
  * File formats, hashes and the library ABI are unchanged.

 -- Pilate <noptical@gmail.com>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:20:10 -0700

sparkey (2.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Python bindings, compatible with spotify/sparkey-python.
  * Replace hash files atomically, sync them to disk before the rename and
    keep the permissions of the file being replaced.
  * Fix sparkey_hash_write hanging on a truncated hash file, when the hash
    size changes, and when the log is appended to while it is indexed.
  * Fix file descriptor and memory leaks on error paths and when the hash
    file is already up to date.
  * Make sparkey_logwriter_close safe to call on a closed writer.
  * Check the results of stat, lseek and malloc, and report EMFILE as
    SPARKEY_TOO_MANY_OPEN_FILES.
  * Detect big-endian platforms correctly when reading files.
  * Stop sparkey appendlog from silently dropping input.

 -- Pilate <noptical@gmail.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:21:09 -0700

sparkey (2.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 2.0.0. The library soname is unchanged (libsparkey.so.0).
  * Build with CMake instead of autotools.
  * Fix build failures with modern GCC and Clang.
  * Fix a path buffer overflow in the bench tool.
  * Fix sparkey rewrite turning deleted keys into empty values and keeping
    replaced entries.
  * Add a sparkey(1) man page.
  * Update packaging to debhelper compat 13 and Standards-Version 4.7.2.
  * Replace libsparkey-dbg with automatic -dbgsym packages.
  * Install libraries to the multiarch directory.

 -- Pilate <noptical@gmail.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:17:10 -0700

